Value Required ADDRESS (\S+)
Value MAC_ADDRESS (\S+)
Value INTERFACE (\S+)
Value VLAN (\S+)
Value PRLVL (\S+)
Value AGE (\S+)
Value STATE (\S+)
Value TIME_LEFT (\S+)

Start
  ^\s*Network\s+Layer\s+Address\s+Link\s+Layer\s+Address\s+Interface\s+vlan\s+prlvl\s+age\s+state\s+Time\s+left.*$$ -> MacFirst
  ^\s*Network\s+Layer\s+Address\s+prlvl\s+age\s+state\s+Time\s+left\s+Link\s+Layer\s+Address\s+Interface\s+vlan.*$$ -> PriorityFirst
  ^.*$$

MacFirst
  ^\s*${ADDRESS}\s+${MAC_ADDRESS}\s+${INTERFACE}\s+${VLAN}\s+${PRLVL}\s+${AGE}\s+${STATE}\s+${TIME_LEFT}(?:\s+.*)?$$ -> Record
  ^.*$$

PriorityFirst
  ^\s*${ADDRESS}\s+${PRLVL}\s+${AGE}\s+${STATE}\s+${TIME_LEFT}\s+${MAC_ADDRESS}\s+${INTERFACE}\s+${VLAN}(?:\s+.*)?$$ -> Record
  ^.*$$
